WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:08.536
This video shows how to set up a department on your phone. Departments group your staff, such as Science or Administration.

00:00:10.198 --> 00:00:21.022
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR & Staff, and choose Departments. The page lists your departments as cards, and designations are further down.

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:29.651
Tap Add Department at the top of the Departments section. A form opens.

00:00:30.499 --> 00:00:40.339
Type the department name, here Science Dept. You can also add a short description, here Physics, Chemistry and Biology teachers.

00:00:45.162 --> 00:00:51.714
Tap Add Department in the form to save. The new department appears in the list as a card.

00:01:03.508 --> 00:01:09.124
The department is saved. You can now choose it when you add a staff member.
